---
title: Add a visible signature to a PDF
description: Draw, type, or upload a signature image — free and private in your browser.
relatedTool: sign-pdf
---

Add a **visible signature** to contracts, forms, or approvals.

## Steps

1. Open **Sign PDF**.
2. Upload your PDF.
3. Create a signature:
   - Draw with mouse or touch
   - Type your name
   - Upload a PNG signature image
4. Place the signature on the page, adjust size and date if needed.
5. Download the signed PDF.

## Tips

> **Info:** For legally binding **digital certificates**, use [Digital Sign PDF](/guides/pdf-digital-sign-p12) instead.

- You can add signatures to multiple pages before downloading.
- Signatures are embedded into the page content for normal viewing.

